{"id":"n82936-2-7","stage":5,"title":"투명 · 透明","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82936-2-7-1","ko":"지수가 하는 말은 항상 애매모호해.","zh":"智秀说的话总是模棱两可的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做出，作出","explanation":"하다：做出，作出；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말은","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"애매모호해.","meaning":"模棱两可，模糊不清","explanation":"애매모호하다：模棱两可，模糊不清；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"애매모호하다","audio":"/audio/0fd7741262527b07e96a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66617","senseId":"1","lemma":"애매모호하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做出，作出","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"露出某种表情或表现出某种态度等。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"0fd7741262527b07","term":"애매모호하다","zh":"模棱两可，模糊不清","audio":"/audio/0fd7741262527b07e96a.mp3","entryId":"66617","definition":"话语或态度等不分明。","pronunciation":["애ː매모호하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e76b39b9a5cbd0bed462.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82936-2-7-2","ko":"응, 지수는 말이나 태도에서 투명을 찾기 어려워.","zh":"对，从智秀的言辞和态度里很难找到坦诚之处。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"말이나","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；이나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"태도에서","meaning":"态度","explanation":"태도：态度；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"태도","audio":"/audio/62b0d1dfdfa9bb281355.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62414","senseId":"2","lemma":"태도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"투명을","meaning":"透明","explanation":"투명：透明；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"투명","audio":"/audio/9beda26265be00fccd6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82936","senseId":"2","lemma":"투명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾기","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어려워.","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"62b0d1dfdfa9bb28","term":"태도","zh":"态度","audio":"/audio/62b0d1dfdfa9bb281355.mp3","entryId":"62414","definition":"对于某事的立场或观点。","pronunciation":["태ː도"]},{"id":"9beda26265be00fc","term":"투명","zh":"透明","audio":"/audio/9beda26265be00fccd6d.mp3","entryId":"82936","definition":"人的言语、态度或发生的状况等非常清晰分明。","pronunciation":["투명"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fdfe252ec47790704c70.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.429,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82936","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["智秀说的话总是模棱两可的。","对，从智秀的言辞和态度里很难找到坦诚之处。","班上的孩子们真是不听话，还特别调皮，对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀说的话总是模棱两可的。","对，从智秀的言辞和态度里很难找到坦诚之处。","班上的孩子们真是不听话，还特别调皮，对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
